   Vendor/LICENSE) is the Apache License 2.0. The files are unchanged except for the edits below,
   which porting from Lean v4.34.1 / Mathlib d13f23b7 to Lean v4.36.0 / Mathlib fc4f59e5 forced.
   Every modified file carries a "Modified" comment at its top naming the change.

   Modified files (29), all under Vendor/OAI/NumberTheory/PiExponent/:
     - 16 files: a multi-line singleton set inside `Ideal.span {...}` is parenthesised
       (Ampleness/AmpleCurveDegreePositive, Ampleness/ExceptionalCurveDegree,
       Cohomology/CartierEulerDifference, Cohomology/CartierMixedEuler,
       Geometry/CartierDegreeLength, Geometry/CartierPowerFrames, Geometry/CartierSequence,
       Geometry/CurveDegreeAdditivity, Geometry/CurveSectionDegree,
       Geometry/GeneralCartierDegreeLength, Geometry/SectionCartierPower,
       Geometry/SectionZeroStalk, Jets/DVRBranchJet, Jets/OrdinaryDVRBranchJet,
       LocalAlgebra/IdealTensorPowers, LocalAlgebra/TensorIdealInclusion);
     - 3 files: the `Nat.strong_induction_on` case renamed `h` -> `ind`
       (Cohomology/TupleCechBound, LocalAlgebra/CoordinateTranscendenceBasis,
       Polynomials/PolynomialNormalNonzero);
     - Analysis/FlintSine, Analysis/FlintConsequence: explicit function for summable_nat_add_iff;
     - Analysis/PeriodAnalytic: `congr 1` replaced by `congrArg`;
     - Approximation/Exponent: one inequality via `div_le_one`;
     - Ampleness/ReesPushdown: Polynomial.coeff_smul / coeff_monomial API changes;
     - Polynomials/PolynomialPoleBound, Geometry/CurveLocalOrder: AddValuation.map signature;
     - LocalAlgebra/FiniteFreeResolutionExt: `simp; rfl` -> `simp <;> rfl`;
     - Geometry/ProjectiveIntrinsicCoefficientLaw: lemmas intrinsic_polynomial and
       intrinsic_ringEquiv removed (the kernel cannot check them on the new pin);
     - Approximation/WeightedPullbackDegree: proof of pullback_supportBound rewritten to avoid
       them (statement unchanged).
   No statement of any theorem was changed.

